[
    {
        "text": "So, this is a bit of a work-in-progress that's slowly coming together. As more data streams are obtained, I'll be folding them in so please excuse place holders. For the moment, I've opted to call it \"R-Observatory\" as it's similar to the \"internet observatory\" in a way; but, just centered on R. There's more support at the moment for CRAN-based projects than Bioconductor projects.\n\nI sorta think of it like a next-gen version of seeing a CRAN page (albeit without trying to be 'next-gen' with just custom CSS, c.f. <https:\/\/rd.thecoatlessprofessor.com\/cran-paint-job\/|rd.thecoatlessprofessor.com\/cran-paint-job>) combined with more advanced analytics and the ability to 'diff' between package versions to understand changes.\n\nDemos:\n\nPackage detail: <https:\/\/r-observatory.thecoatlessprofessor.com\/packages\/ggplot2\/|r-observatory.thecoatlessprofessor.com\/packages\/ggplot2>\nPackage comparison: <https:\/\/r-observatory.thecoatlessprofessor.com\/packages\/ggplot2\/compare\/3.0.0...4.0.0|r-observatory.thecoatlessprofessor.com\/packages\/ggplot2\/compare\/3.0.0...4.0.0>",
